ification of Germany post-war. Nuremberg trials convict top Nazis. Former Nazis are employed by the West in the Cold War struggle against the Soviet Union.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_PlutoTVVarldskrigen_se","title":"Weapons That Changed the World","released":"2026-11-28T15:21:15Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T15:21:15Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T16:20:29Z","overview":"The AK-47, the world's deadliest firearm, sparked a Cold War race for superior assault rifles like the American M4 and German HK 416. Host Wil Willis explores its history, from Mikhail Kalashnikov's WWII experiences to its assembly and lethal impact.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_PlutoTVVarldskrigen_se","title":"Hitler Uncovering His Fatal Obsession: Time is Blood 1942-5","released":"2026-11-28T16:20:29Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T16:20:29Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T17:17:36Z","overview":"Episode 2 begins after the desperate German winter of 1941. Yet 1942 began badly for the Soviets, with more vicious Nazi campaigning seeing millions more Russians captured and starved.","genres":["Series","War"]},{"id":"ftv_PlutoTVVarldskrigen_se","title":"Secret War: Hardy Amies and Operation Ratweek","released":"2026-11-28T17:17:36Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T17:17:36Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T18:17:59Z","overview":"Operation Ratweek’s existence has always been denied. However WMR has now discovered evidence that it existed and was carried out.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_PlutoTVVarldskrigen_se","title":"Secret War: Agent Garbo","released":"2026-11-28T18:17:59Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T18:17:59Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T19:20:14Z","overview":"Juan Pujol, MI6's WWII agent \"Garbo,\" created a fictitious spy network in Lisbon, deceiving the Germans with crucial disinformation and influencing their strategies. After the war, MI6 protected him, and he lived in Venezuela until his death in 1988.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_PlutoTVVarldskrigen_se","title":"Secret War: